     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In context",
     "texto": [
      "The passive lets you emphasise the process or result when the agent does not matter: «De aanvraag wordt beoordeeld» (the application is assessed). A construction with «er wordt…» usually presents an impersonal activity; choose according to the information focus."
